OL,3,GNEWSATwo-year revamp of suspension
OL,4,Abridge is complete
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe multi-million pound refurbishment
OL,7,Fof one of the world's oldest surviving
OL,8,Firon suspension bridges has been
OL,9,Fcompleted.
OL,11,FWork to restore Clifton Suspension
OL,12,FBridge in Bristol began in April 2024,
OL,13,Ffocusing on protecting its historic
OL,14,Fironwork and installing an
OL,15,Fenvironmentally sustainable lighting
OL,16,Fsystem.
OL,18,FThe project, which was funded through
OL,19,Fbridge tolls, represents the most
OL,20,Fsignificant conservation investment
OL,21,Fsince the structure opened in 1864.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
